# Database backups.
#
# These are full dumps of the live database — every customer's name, number,
# Emirates ID reference and contract. 215 MB of it sits here, and none of it
# belongs in a repository that gets cloned onto laptops and CI runners.
#
# Ignored rather than merely untracked: untracked is one `git add -A` away
# from being committed for good, and a secret in git history stays there.
backups/

# The scratch files a probe or a migration leaves behind.
tmp-*.mjs
